    "updated_at": "2022-01-20T14:10:05Z",
    "body": "I think removing \"non-standard\" is good, and mark particular features as deprecated if there's a reasonable path to remove it. In the case of `-webkit-device-pixel-ratio` I don't think it can be deprecated yet due to lack of Safari support for `resolution`.",
